  "title": "France Loto Results and Winning Numbers",
  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1733\" class=\"elementor elementor-1733\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-59b88788 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"70892\" data-id=\"59b88788\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7bf43831\" data-eae-slider=\"37587\" data-id=\"7bf43831\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ffa2a89 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7ffa2a89\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"894\" height=\"427\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/france.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5831\" alt=\"french lotto\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/france.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/france-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/france-768x367.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 894px) 100vw, 894px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"></figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6afe54b7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"83630\" data-id=\"6afe54b7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1a9b572b\" data-eae-slider=\"13663\" data-id=\"1a9b572b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c28e0ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2c28e0ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About the French Loto</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7c924f22 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"25486\" data-id=\"7c924f22\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-44f1411e\" data-eae-slider=\"14278\" data-id=\"44f1411e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96af7cd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"96af7cd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Since its launch in 1976, the French Loto lottery has produced millionaires by paying substantial non-jackpot prize money. It’s become one of the most popular games offered by the Française des Jeux (FDJ), the operators for all French lottery games.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Playing the </span><b>lottery with French Loto</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> means that you stand the chance of winning a minimum jackpot of €2 million. Each time the draw doesn’t produce a jackpot winner, it rolls over to the next draw, and the operator adds €1 million to the pool. The prize could roll over up to 34 times. </span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Though the odds of winning the jackpot lie around 1:19,068,840, it would still be a life-changing win. You’ll also find overall odds of 1:5.99 in winning a prize with the French Loto lottery. Either way, you could be a winner. Here are a few FAQs to help you get started.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4cd9284c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"56044\" data-id=\"4cd9284c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-70372ef9\" data-eae-slider=\"98106\" data-id=\"70372ef9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20e84f67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"20e84f67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">French Loto FAQ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7348e832 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-eae-slider=\"23450\" data-id=\"7348e832\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3b6f7e82\" data-eae-slider=\"1767\" data-id=\"3b6f7e82\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-50f94b4e elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"50f94b4e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-50f94b4e\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"50f94b4e\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"who-can-play-french-loto-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1351\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Who Can Play French Loto? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1351\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"who-can-play-french-loto-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Anyone of the legal gambling age can play. There are more restricted locations. Players from anywhere in the world can choose </span><b>French Loto lottery numbers </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">and stand a chance to win the prizes offered in each draw. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"who-won-the-biggest-jackpot-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1352\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Who Won the Biggest Jackpot? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1352\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"who-won-the-biggest-jackpot-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">From all the </span><b>French Loto lottery winners</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">, the biggest jackpot won was in June 2011. It was worth €24 million and won by a single ticket holder. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-chances-of-winning-the-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1353\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Chances of Winning the Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1353\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-chances-of-winning-the-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">To win, you need to have drawn all five main </span><b>French Loto lottery numbers </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">plus the chance number. The statistical odds of this occurrence is 1 in 19,068,840.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-you-play-the-french-loto-lottery-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1354\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How Do You Play the French Loto Lottery? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1354\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-you-play-the-french-loto-lottery-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">All players choose five numbers from 1 to 49 and a chance number from 1 to 10. Each ticket costs €2.20. If you have a ticket that matches all six of the drawn numbers, you’ll win the top prize. There are also other prizes such as a €2.20 reimbursement if you match the chance number only and €100,000 if you match all five of the main numbers. You can use the </span><b>French Loto lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> to check if you qualify for any prizes. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-french-loto-usually-drawn-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1355\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the French Loto Usually Drawn? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1355\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-french-loto-usually-drawn-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The French Loto draw takes place on Monday, Wednesday, and Saturday evenings at 20:35 CET. It is vital to note that the ticket sales end at 8 pm, just before the draw occurs. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-does-the-mega-millions-drawing-take-place-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1356\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Does the Mega Millions Drawing Take Place? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1356\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"when-does-the-mega-millions-drawing-take-place-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The Mega Millions draw for the </span><b>French Loto lottery results </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">takes place on Fridays. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-does-the-second-chance-lottery-operate\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1357\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How Does the Second Chance Lottery Operate?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1357\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"how-does-the-second-chance-lottery-operate\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">After the</span><b> results of the French Loto lottery</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> are released, there is the 2nd draw. For an extra fee of €0.80, players stand a chance to win €100,000 thanks to the 2nd draw. During the 2nd draw, another set of winning numbers between 1 and 49 are drawn. There are prizes for matching between two and five numbers. However, players must enter the main French Loto draw, and the prize is fixed and does not ever roll over. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-cash-in-lottery-tickets-and-will-i-pay-taxes-\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1358\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How to Cash in Lottery Tickets, and Will I Pay Taxes? </span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1358\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-cash-in-lottery-tickets-and-will-i-pay-taxes-\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you have a physical ticket, you have 60 days to collect your prizes. If you played online via the </span><b>French Loto lottery app </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">in France, your winnings would be paid to either your player or bank account after security checks. French Loto prizes are tax-free lump sums. However, they may be liable for taxes in your country so ensure that you check with your local financial advisor. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-997a14a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"30636\" data-id=\"997a14a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-179d6af7\" data-eae-slider=\"76139\" data-id=\"179d6af7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d42cf4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2d42cf4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the French Loto Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-41523f6a\" data-eae-slider=\"67450\" data-id=\"41523f6a\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f637e6d elementor-align-center elementor-button-success elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"3f637e6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-lg\" href=\"/Contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Send Us an Email</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-61eae30 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"65285\" data-id=\"61eae30\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0091951\" data-eae-slider=\"76427\" data-id=\"0091951\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb0dbd2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"fb0dbd2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Who Can Play French Loto?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Anyone of the legal gambling age can play. There are more restricted locations. Players from anywhere in the world can choose French Loto lottery numbers and stand a chance to win the prizes offered in each draw.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Who Won the Biggest Jackpot?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"From all the French Loto lottery winners , the biggest jackpot won was in June 2011. It was worth \\u20ac24 million and won by a single ticket holder.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Are the Chances of Winning the Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"To win, you need to have drawn all five main French Loto lottery numbers plus the chance number. The statistical odds of this occurrence is 1 in 19,068,840.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How Do You Play the French Loto Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"All players choose five numbers from 1 to 49 and a chance number from 1 to 10. Each ticket costs \\u20ac2.20. If you have a ticket that matches all six of the drawn numbers, you\\u2019ll win the top prize. There are also other prizes such as a \\u20ac2.20 reimbursement if you match the chance number only and \\u20ac100,000 if you match all five of the main numbers. You can use the French Loto lottery ticket scanner to check if you qualify for any prizes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When Is the French Loto Usually Drawn?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The French Loto draw takes place on Monday, Wednesday, and Saturday evenings at 20:35 CET. It is vital to note that the ticket sales end at 8 pm, just before the draw occurs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When Does the Mega Millions Drawing Take Place?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Mega Millions draw for the French Loto lottery results takes place on Fridays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How Does the Second Chance Lottery Operate?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"After the results of the French Loto lottery are released, there is the 2nd draw. For an extra fee of \\u20ac0.80, players stand a chance to win \\u20ac100,000 thanks to the 2nd draw. During the 2nd draw, another set of winning numbers between 1 and 49 are drawn. There are prizes for matching between two and five numbers. However, players must enter the main French Loto draw, and the prize is fixed and does not ever roll over.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How to Cash in Lottery Tickets, and Will I Pay Taxes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"If you have a physical ticket, you have 60 days to collect your prizes. If you played online via the French Loto lottery app in France, your winnings would be paid to either your player or bank account after security checks. French Loto prizes are tax-free lump sums. However, they may be liable for taxes in your country so ensure that you check with your local financial advisor.\"}}]}</script>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
